---
// Mission Component
---

<section data-section-theme="light" id="mission" class="pb-24 md:pb-32 bg-[#F0ECDE]">
  <!-- Hero Image -->
  <div class="pt-0">
    <div class="w-full h-[40vh] md:h-[60vh] overflow-hidden mb-16 md:mb-24 relative fade-up">
      <div class="parallax-bg absolute inset-0 scale-110" data-parallax-speed="0.2">
        <video
          autoplay
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          aria-label="NOUVATION MISSION"
        >
          <source src="https://pgwepetbondrqvwflaaw.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/nouvation/mission.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Section Title (Center Aligned) -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-24 fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-[5rem] font-bold mb-2 leading-[1.2] text-[#231815]">
        <span class="font-maru">MISSION</span>
      </h2>
      <!-- <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[#231815]">
        知らなかったで失われる機会をなくし、<br class="hidden md:block" />
        伝わらなかったを届いたに変える。
      </p> -->
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="fade-up">
        <h3 class="char-reveal text-2xl md:text-[2.8rem] font-bold mb-8 leading-relaxed text-[#231815]">
          <span class="block">情報格差をなくし、</span><span class="block">農家の利益を最大化する。</span>
        </h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 text-[#231815] leading-loose text-lg">
          <p>
            農業界には、優れた技術や想いがありながらも、<br />情報が届かないために正当な評価を受けられていない現場が<br />まだ数多く残っています。
          </p>
          <p>
            市場動向・補助金制度・現場ノウハウを<br />SNSで全国の農家さんに届ける。<br />農業の情報インフラとして<br />農家の皆さまが持つ可能性を最大限に引き出します。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Image Content -->
      <div class="fade-up">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative group bg-[#464237]">
          <img 
            src="/images/mission.jpg" 
            alt="農業の未来を切り拓く" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#231815]/30 to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 土の中の微生物世界 -->
  <div class="relative h-[30vh] md:h-[40vh] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0ECDE] via-[#3d2b1a] to-[#0a0a0a]">
    <!-- 土の層グラデーション -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#8B7355]/30 via-[#2a1a0a] to-[#050505]"></div>

    <!-- 微生物パーティクル -->
    <div class="microbe-container absolute inset-0">
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 15%; --y: 45%; --size: 3px; --delay: 0s; --duration: 4s; --glow-color: #7fff7f;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 30%; --y: 60%; --size: 2px; --delay: 0.8s; --duration: 3.5s; --glow-color: #7fffdf;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 50%; --y: 50%; --size: 4px; --delay: 1.2s; --duration: 5s; --glow-color: #D4FF00;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 70%; --y: 65%; --size: 2px; --delay: 0.3s; --duration: 3s; --glow-color: #7fff7f;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 85%; --y: 40%; --size: 3px; --delay: 2s; --duration: 4.5s; --glow-color: #aaffaa;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 25%; --y: 75%; --size: 2px; --delay: 1.5s; --duration: 3.8s; --glow-color: #D4FF00;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 60%; --y: 35%; --size: 3px; --delay: 0.5s; --duration: 4.2s; --glow-color: #7fffbf;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 40%; --y: 80%; --size: 2px; --delay: 2.5s; --duration: 3.2s; --glow-color: #aaffaa;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 10%; --y: 55%; --size: 2px; --delay: 1.8s; --duration: 4.8s; --glow-color: #7fff7f;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 90%; --y: 70%; --size: 3px; --delay: 0.7s; --duration: 3.6s; --glow-color: #D4FF00;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 45%; --y: 30%; --size: 2px; --delay: 3s; --duration: 5.5s; --glow-color: #7fffdf;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 75%; --y: 55%; --size: 4px; --delay: 1s; --duration: 4s; --glow-color: #aaffaa;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 20%; --y: 85%; --size: 2px; --delay: 2.2s; --duration: 3.4s; --glow-color: #7fff7f;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 55%; --y: 70%; --size: 3px; --delay: 0.2s; --duration: 4.6s; --glow-color: #D4FF00;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 35%; --y: 42%; --size: 2px; --delay: 1.7s; --duration: 3.9s; --glow-color: #7fffbf;"></div>
      <div class="microbe" style="--x: 80%; --y: 25%; --size: 2px; --delay: 2.8s; --duration: 5.2s; --glow-color: #aaffaa;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 根っこのシルエット（SVG） -->
    <svg class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[60%] opacity-[0.08]" viewBox="0 0 1440 400" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <path d="M720,0 C720,0 710,80 700,150 C690,220 650,350 620,400" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M720,0 C725,0 740,100 760,180 C780,260 820,350 850,400" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M700,150 C700,150 670,180 640,200 C610,220 560,250 520,280" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M760,180 C760,180 800,210 830,230 C860,250 900,280 940,310" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M720,0 C718,0 715,60 705,100 C695,140 660,200 630,250" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .microbe {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--x);
    top: var(--y);
    width: var(--size);
    height: var(--size);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--glow-color);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 4px var(--glow-color),
      0 0 8px var(--glow-color),
      0 0 16px var(--glow-color),
      0 0 32px var(--glow-color);
    animation: microbe-float var(--duration) ease-in-out var(--delay) infinite,
               microbe-pulse var(--duration) ease-in-out var(--delay) infinite;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @keyframes microbe-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    25% { transform: translate(8px, -12px); }
    50% { transform: translate(-5px, -8px); }
    75% { transform: translate(10px, 5px); }
  }

  @keyframes microbe-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.2; }
    30% { opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { opacity: 1; }
    70% { opacity: 0.6; }
  }
</style>